Maintainer: Khronos31 <39792509+Khronos31@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://go.dev/
Tag: purpose::console
Description: Go programming language compiler, linker, compiled stdlib
 Built on-device for rootless jailbreaks. The linker signs every executable
 it produces with ldid, using the entitlements plist in GOROOT, because
 jailbroken iOS kills unsigned binaries. GOROOT is baked in, so it does not
 have to be set in the environment.
